# --- notepad.reg ---
# HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT is represented by the mounted SOFTWARE\Classes hive offline.
& 'reg' 'add' 'HKLM\zSOFTWARE\Classes\*\shell\ClassicNotepad' '/v' 'MUIVerb' '/t' 'REG_SZ' '/d' 'Edit with Notepad (Classic)' '/f' | Out-Null
